OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity firm pays out #750k to
OL,4,Acharities after investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firm which was once the third biggest
OL,7,Felectricity supplier to homes in
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland has paid #750,000 to
OL,9,Fcharity following a Utility Regulator
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,FElectric Ireland's working practices
OL,13,Fwere examined by the watchdog due to
OL,14,Fallegations it had failed to comply
OL,15,Fwith the terms of its licence to supply
OL,16,Felectricity.
OL,18,FThe investigation looked at issues such
OL,19,Fas how the firm communicated with
OL,20,Fdomestic customers, how it handled
OL,21,Fcomplaints and how it marketed
OL,22,Felectricity.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
