OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity firm pays out #750k to
OL,4,Acharities after investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe regulator has now closed its
OL,7,Fthree-year investigation after the firm
OL,8,Fproposed an "alternative resolution"
OL,9,Fwhich included payments to five
OL,10,Fcharities, some of which support people
OL,11,Fwho struggle to pay energy bills.
